{"title": "Destroyed Kill Collar", "pageid": 50820, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Destroyed_Kill_Collar", "categories": ["Amulets", "Common items"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"> \n</p>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\"><figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Dog_Collar_A_Faded.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/53/Dog_Collar_A_Faded.png/300px-Dog_Collar_A_Faded.png.webp, /w/images/5/53/Dog_Collar_A_Faded.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Destroyed Kill Collar image\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/53/Dog_Collar_A_Faded.png/300px-Dog_Collar_A_Faded.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/53/Dog_Collar_A_Faded.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\"><span style=\"color: #FFFFFF ;\">Destroyed  Kill Collar</span></a> is an common <a href=\"/wiki/Amulets\" title=\"Amulets\">Amulet</a> that represents the destroyed collars used by <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Enver_Gortash\" title=\"Enver Gortash\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/59/Portrait_Enver_Gortash.png/25px-Portrait_Enver_Gortash.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/59/Portrait_Enver_Gortash.png/38px-Portrait_Enver_Gortash.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/59/Portrait_Enver_Gortash.png/50px-Portrait_Enver_Gortash.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Gortash\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/59/Portrait_Enver_Gortash.png/25px-Portrait_Enver_Gortash.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/59/Portrait_Enver_Gortash.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Enver_Gortash\" title=\"Enver Gortash\">Gortash</a> to keep the <a href=\"/wiki/Gondians\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Gondians\">Gondians</a> within the <a href=\"/wiki/Steel_Watch_Foundry\" title=\"Steel Watch Foundry\">Iron Foundry</a> in check.\n</p>\n<div style=\"font-size:110%; font-family:'Linux Libertine', 'Georgia', serif; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div style=\"opacity: 0.5; margin: 0.5em 0.5em 0.5em 0;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/36px-Description_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-blockquote-text\" style=\"width:100px; flex-grow: 1; font-style: italic;\">\n<p>Smells a bit rusty, but looks stylish nonetheless.\n</p>\n</div></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\"> Properties </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\" style=\"margin-left: 7px\"> \n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Amulets\" title=\"Amulets\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e5/Amulets_Icon.png/25px-Amulets_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e5/Amulets_Icon.png/38px-Amulets_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e5/Amulets_Icon.png/50px-Amulets_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Amulets\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e5/Amulets_Icon.png/25px-Amulets_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a hre